From a17bb4284e7da5ab5f3e092426218ffbf3b14fc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:39:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix: body and posture fit of the narrator's ideas: arm
 tells for upright fighters' arms, twin tails, no hind legs/fingers/hands on
 the wrong body, posture bans (face-up, standing, lying), voice bans per
 fighter, spent hold reactions and pin tries, softer wear and press looks, no
 bones breaking in boneless parts

---
 blocks.py        | 33 ++++++++++++++--
 engine.py        | 24 +++++++-----
 narrator.py      | 99 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 story_blocks.txt |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

